  "description": "Yun-Seop is the picture-perfect student body president, a model student adored by his peers, respected by his juniors, and favored by his professors. Beneath his flawless campus facade, however, lies a heavily guarded secret: he manages his overwhelming stress through intense solo pleasure. \n\nHis pristine reputation shatters when Gyeong-Dae, a gloomy, normally invisible junior who blends into the background, catches him in the act. Instead of spreading rumors, Gyeong-Dae makes a startling proposition, offering his silence on one condition: Yun-Seop must become his private sex partner. \n\nForced into a secretive arrangement to protect his status, Yun-Seop reluctantly agrees. However, he quickly realizes that the quiet junior is far more dominant behind closed doors. As Gyeong-Dae introduces him to intoxicating, mind-melting pleasure, the dark dynamic begins to consume Yun-Seop, leaving him hopelessly addicted to the very person he once overlooked.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
